.skamyxatra

The {gismu} creation algorithm is described in section 4.14 of *The Complete
Lojban Language*, available in various places on the web.  Incidentally, the
languages used were Arabic, Chinese, English, Hindi, Russian, and Spanish,
though that was in 1987, and Russian's place in the top six world languages has
since been supplanted by Portuguese.

